# .trivyignore — accepted vulnerability IDs, one per line, each with a
# justification and a review date. Populate from the first Trivy run
# (Security tab → Code scanning → category "trivy"), then flip the sca-iac
# step's exit-code to '1' to make HIGH/CRITICAL block merges.
#
# Example:
# CVE-2023-XXXXX  # base-image glibc, no upstream fix yet — review 2026-11